OL,3,GNEWSALockerbie bombing intended to
OL,4,Ainflict 'pain and horror', US court
OL,5,Atold
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe bombing of an American airliner
OL,8,Fover Lockerbie 37 years ago was
OL,9,Fintended to inflict "pain and horror,"
OL,10,Fa judge has been told.
OL,12,FThe US government made the claim as it
OL,13,Fargued that relatives of the victims
OL,14,Fshould be allowed to give evidence
OL,15,Fduring the trial of a Libyan suspect.
OL,17,FProsecutors believe their testimony
OL,18,Fwill help the jury understand the
OL,19,Fimpact of the attack, which killed 270
OL,20,Fpeople on December 21, 1988.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
